  "arrangerNotes": "State song of Texas: verse 1 and the refrain (once), verified against the LilyPond score on English Wikipedia. Words as originally published ('Largest and grandest'; the official text changed this to 'Boldest and grandest' in 1959, which is what the Wikipedia score shows). The score's rests are kept. No simplification needed. Range 1 to high 1: C and D minLayout 8. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
